2:ol:OL34311050W"},"before":null,"after":{"title":"Truth or Dare","author_id":"@a1","first_publish_year":2021,"open_library_id":"OL34311050W","cover_id":13189148,"source_type":"open_library","work_type":"novel","native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL34311050W","id":987100001}},{"ref":"e1","relation":"editions","key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL46531150M"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w1","open_library_edition_id":"OL46531150M","isbn_13":"9789022591208","isbn_10":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V.","title":"Niemand zeggen","id":987200001,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":13189148}},{"ref":"d1","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":"@w1","language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w1","language":"nl","bound_author_id":"@a1","text":"In Southampton volgen gewelddadige gebeurtenissen elkaar op terwijl een economische crisis de onrust vergroot. Inspecteur Helen Grace probeert met haar team te achterhalen of afzonderlijke misdrijven bij elkaar horen. Ook binnen de politie neemt de druk toe: Charlie is met zwangerschapsverlof en Joseph Hudson werkt Helen tegen. Terwijl het onderzoek om aandacht vraagt, dreigt zij de grip op haar eigen werkomgeving te verliezen. De roman volgt haar zoektocht naar samenhang tussen de zaken.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.lannoo.com/nl-be/thrillers-spanning/niemand-zeggen-9789052863962","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p432476733","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p433926074"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T15:25:00.000Z","reference":"ol:OL34311050W"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://www.lannoo.com/nl-be/thrillers-spanning/niemand-zeggen-9789052863962","https://www.bibliotheek.nl/catalogus/titel.432476733.html/niemand-zeggen/","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p432476733","https://data.bibliotheken