tor","author_id":"@a9","first_publish_year":2000,"open_library_id":"OL52936W","cover_id":9154925,"source_type":"open_library","work_type":"novel","native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL52936W","id":987100011}},{"ref":"e11","relation":"editions","key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL27729911M"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w11","open_library_edition_id":"OL27729911M","isbn_13":"9789024568963","isbn_10":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Luitingh Sijthoff","title":"De bezoeker","id":987200011,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":9154925}},{"ref":"d11","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":"@w11","language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w11","language":"nl","bound_author_id":"@a9","text":"Twee vrouwen die eerder bij het leger werkten worden vermoord aangetroffen. Hun loopbanen vertonen overeenkomsten en beiden kenden Jack Reacher. Ook de omstandigheden van hun dood lijken bij elkaar te horen. Het profiel van een mogelijke dader maakt de zaak voor Reacher bijzonder ongemakkelijk: verschillende kenmerken passen bij hemzelf. Terwijl de verbanden tussen de slachtoffers worden onderzocht, moet hij duidelijk krijgen wie hun verleden heeft gebruikt en waarom juist deze vrouwen zijn uitgekozen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL52936W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p389935840"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T15:25:00.000Z","reference":"ol:OL52936W"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL52936W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p389935840"],"review":"content-review-003.json"},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":9154925,"sha256":"228097d8c8d4dccc25a9dbde754060921e47c3d9be43685ef6583e8d39045a91","reference":"cover-semantic-review-001.json","limitation":"Front title/author and exact source-edition mapping; no visible barcode claim."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T15:25:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-001"}},{"ref":"m11","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":"@e11"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@e11","work_id":"@w11","bound_author_id":"@a9","bound_title":"De bezoeker","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789024568963","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/9154925-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/9154925-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p389935840","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p389935840"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T15:25:00.000Z","reference":"ol:OL52936W"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL52936W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p389935840"],"review":"content-review-003.json"},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":9154925,"sha256":"228097d8c8d4dccc25a9dbde754060921e47c3d9be43685ef6583e8d39045a91","reference":"cover-semantic-review-001.json","limitation":"Front title/author and exact source-edition mapping; no visible barcode claim."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T15:25:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-001"}},{"ref":"w12","relation":"works","key":{"native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL19749410W"},"before":null,"after":{"title":"The spy and the traitor","author_id":"@a10","first_publish_year":2018,"open_library_id":"OL19749410W","cover_id":10528667,"source_type":"open_library","work_type":null,"native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL19749410W","id":987100012}},{"ref":"e12","relation":"editions","key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL31808456M"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w12","open_library_edition_id":"OL31808456M","isbn_13":"9789022586761","isbn_10":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Boekerij","title":"De spion en de verrader","id":987200012,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":10528667}},{"ref":"d12","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":"@w12","language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w12","language":"nl","bound_author_id":"@a10","text":"Oleg Gordievsky werkt binnen de Sovjet-inlichtingendienst, maar verstrekt in het geheim informatie aan de Britten. Ben Macintyre volgt zijn dubbelbestaan en de risico''s die daarmee samenhangen. De zoektocht van de Amerikanen naar deze waardevolle bron maakt de situatie nog ingewikkelder, zeker wanneer ook aan hun kant iemand voor de tegenstander blijkt te werken. Het boek beschrijft hoe persoonlijke overtuigingen, vertrouwen en verraad elkaar tijdens de Koude Oorlog raken in de wereld van de geheime diensten.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.lannoo.com/nl-nl/geschiedenis/de-spion-en-de-verrader-9789022586761","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p422984353"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T15:25:00.000Z","reference":"ol:OL19749410W"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://www.lannoo.com/nl-nl/geschiedenis/de-spion-en-de-verrader-9789022586761","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL19749410W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p422984353"],"review":"content-review-004.json"},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":10528667,"sha256":"4f967f37adedf204c6a8bccc58fea133cf986a28def82fb21fb5c28d83fd2e39","reference":"cover-semantic-review-001.json","limitation":"Front title/author and exact source-edition mapping; no visible barcode claim."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T15:25:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-001"}},{"ref":"m12","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":"@e12"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@e12","work_id":